https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/labels/F:%20comments","name":"F: comments","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"The syntactic kind. Not in the language grammar, always on our minds. Best bugs."}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":15,"created_at":"2021-04-11T13:59:54Z","updated_at":"2025-10-18T13:36:19Z","closed_at":"2025-10-18T13:36:19Z","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Currently, the implementation of `is_type_comment()` looks like this:\r\n```\r\ndef is_type_comment(leaf: Leaf, suffix: str = \"\") -> bool:\r\n    \"\"\"Return True if the given leaf is a special comment.\r\n    Only returns true for type comments for now.\"\"\"\r\n    t = leaf.type\r\n    v = leaf.value\r\n    return t in {token.COMMENT, STANDALONE_COMMENT} and v.startswith(\"# type:\" + suffix)\r\n```\r\nBut this is wrong, because typed-ast also recognizes a comment with multiple spaces after the `#` as a type comment. Concretely this could lead Black to skip some of the checks we have to avoid moving type comments to the wrong line.\r\n\r\nIdeally, Black should also standardize the formatting of type comments by cleaning up excessive whitespace after the `#` and after the `:`.","closed_by":{"login":"cobaltt7","id":61329810,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMzI5ODEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61329810?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7","html_url":"https://github.com/cobaltt7","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cobaltt7/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/2097/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psf/black/issues/2097/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}